{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Fixed provider prefix list. A prefix is kept visible in a mask only if listed here and only at the start of the value. length/minLength/maxLength are whole-value lengths including the prefix; charset is a RegExp character-class body every character after the prefix must match. This file is the ONE source of provider formats: masking (kept prefixes) and S-R3 provider_format_exact (matchProviderFormat) both read it. Shapes are from public provider documentation and are unverified against live tokens.",
